        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Hughes, David William \"Hughesy\" Hughes, Fletcher Pilon, Morris\n- Shows: Australia's Got Talent (season 8), another show\n- Roles: host, comedian, radio presenter, television presenter, singer, songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Hughes was born as David William \"Hughesy\" Hughes on 26 November 1970 in Warrnambool, Victoria.\n- Dave Hughes is an Australian stand-up comedian and a radio and television presenter.\n- Fletcher Pilon was born on 6 April 2001.\n- In March 2016, Fletcher Pilon won the eighth season of Australia's Got Talent.\n- On Australia's Got Talent season 8, Morris did not return as host because she was committed to another show.\n- On Australia's Got Talent season 8, Dave Hughes replaced Morris as the host.\n- Fletcher Pilon is an Australian acoustic singer and songwriter.",
